                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "2c1115b0-1308-37ee-a85e-341bbdd88701",
                        "entry_id": "5062322b-173d-331e-8857-479d2f8f02e0",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Haltung/Handlungsweise, die von Mutlosigkeit und mangelnder Entschlusskraft geprägt ist"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "6266d46b-fa0b-492c-a308-a8f7eb6983ed",
                                "sense_id": "2c1115b0-1308-37ee-a85e-341bbdd88701",
                                "text": "„Dein Kleinmut dich beschämt. Gibt’s was, das dich bewege? Du weißt es zwar tief drinnen, doch fehlt die Kraft zum Handeln.“"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "d1b41f54-6148-4516-9e98-5e035c08f8ca",
                                "sense_id": "2c1115b0-1308-37ee-a85e-341bbdd88701",
                                "text": "„Den verborgenen Hintergrund dieser skurrilen Rede kann man leicht erraten. »Goslar ist sich seines eigenen Wertes nicht immer voll bewusst. Kleinmut macht sich manchmal breit«.“"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "a008d09b-6d2b-4779-b585-b9f405715cfb",
                                "sense_id": "2c1115b0-1308-37ee-a85e-341bbdd88701",
                                "text": "„Aller Kleinmut war fortgeweht, jetzt hatte keiner jemals am glücklichen Erfolg der tollkühnen Reise gezweifelt.“"
                            }
                        ],
                        "sense_index_json": "\"1\""
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "d0fecbbd-8013-40d6-9c92-b374644b3693",
                        "source_entry_id": "5062322b-173d-331e-8857-479d2f8f02e0",
                        "source_sense_id": "2c1115b0-1308-37ee-a85e-341bbdd88701",
                        "source_sense_description": "Haltung/Handlungsweise, die von Mutlosigkeit und mangelnder Entschlusskraft geprägt ist",
                        "target_lang_word": "pusillanimity",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "pusillanimity",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "f65a8a7e-7de3-3dfa-89a3-8cb65fc7eed6",
                                        "entry_id": "cc1f1663-4d3c-34da-b70b-34fd66a6279e",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The quality or state of being pusillanimous; the vice of being timid and cowardly, and thus not living up to one's full potential; pusillanimousness."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "2ceeebd1-08bb-4c44-98c3-0823e3fdc816",
                                                "sense_id": "f65a8a7e-7de3-3dfa-89a3-8cb65fc7eed6",
                                                "text": "The ſecond property of your excellent ſherris, is the vvarming of the blood, vvhich before (cold & ſetled) left the lyuer vvhite & pale, vvhich is the badge of puſilanimitie and covvardize: but the ſherris vvarmes it, and makes it courſe from the invvards to the partes extreames, […]"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "f7a64384-61ae-4d04-9e50-f1d391379064",
                                                "sense_id": "f65a8a7e-7de3-3dfa-89a3-8cb65fc7eed6",
                                                "text": "[…] Puſillanimity; by vvhich that ſeems great to him, vvhich other men think a trifle: and vvhatſoever is nevv, or great, and therefore thought fit to be told, vvithdravves a man by degrees from the intended vvay of his diſcourſe."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "80a0a797-091a-47e2-bbda-9424f11876ce",
                                                "sense_id": "f65a8a7e-7de3-3dfa-89a3-8cb65fc7eed6",
                                                "text": "1685. Dr. Michael de Molinos: The Spiritual Guide which Disentangles the Soul, and Brings it by the Inward Way To The Getting of Perfect Contemplation and the Rich Treasure of Internal Peace, CHAP. XVIII: http://www.ccel.org/ccel/molinos/guide.html.\n132. And although thou often fallest, and seest thy Pusillanimity, and endeavour to get courage, and afflict not thy self; because what God doth not do in forty Years, he sometimes doth in an instant, with a particular Mystery, that we may live low and humble, and know that ‘tis the Work of his powerful Hand, to free us from Sins."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "f8dcf071-c84c-4702-b0d3-facb3ffafe17",
                                                "sense_id": "f65a8a7e-7de3-3dfa-89a3-8cb65fc7eed6",
                                                "text": "Instead of being confined within the walls of fortified cities, which the Romans considered as the refuge of weakness or pusillanimity, the legions were encamped on the banks of the great rivers, and along the frontiers of the barbarians."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "9a67defb-3b60-4c37-9adc-d136fac36a98",
                                                "sense_id": "f65a8a7e-7de3-3dfa-89a3-8cb65fc7eed6",
                                                "text": "their hectorings against an absent enemy, and their pusillanimity on his approach"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "cb9ab355-048a-47ee-ad9f-7a2b7ec407bd",
                                                "sense_id": "f65a8a7e-7de3-3dfa-89a3-8cb65fc7eed6",
                                                "text": "What I did through indolence and in some degree, I confess, through pusillanimity, I had a fancy to make it appear (by dint of much whistling, as it were, and easy thrusting of my hands into my pocket) that I did through a sort of generous condescension."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "56cc6a8e-c231-42cd-9da9-c9b8b5135dd3",
                        "source_entry_id": "5062322b-173d-331e-8857-479d2f8f02e0",
                        "source_sense_id": "2c1115b0-1308-37ee-a85e-341bbdd88701",
                        "source_sense_description": "Haltung/Handlungsweise, die von Mutlosigkeit und mangelnder Entschlusskraft geprägt ist",
                        "target_lang_word": "pusillanimité",
                        "target_lang_code": "fr",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "pusillanimité",
                                "target_lang_code": "fr",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "353ea9bb-71b1-30e6-be6c-2f14fe3bc16a",
                                        "entry_id": "9152e0af-3080-3e89-83ec-484d76e67c50",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Excessive timidité, manque de courage."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "a99032d2-5552-4814-b4b4-6fc621fc4933",
                                                "sense_id": "353ea9bb-71b1-30e6-be6c-2f14fe3bc16a",
                                                "text": "Après avoir mis la lettre à la boîte, le vétérinaire sentit pourtant une onde de frayeur et de regret courir sous sa jaquette, en songeant au redoutable secret qu’il venait de confier à la poste. Il se ressaisit aussitôt et s’accusa de pusillanimité."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "961f83fc-9ba5-42ff-90ee-31cf460a7d1c",
                                                "sense_id": "353ea9bb-71b1-30e6-be6c-2f14fe3bc16a",
                                                "text": "Pusillanimité occidentale face à la Russie"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "a793cc75-e2ed-49f6-a858-dca40b284f9c",
                                                "sense_id": "353ea9bb-71b1-30e6-be6c-2f14fe3bc16a",
                                                "text": "Lorsqu'il prévint les Tripolitains de l'attaque prochaine du sultan Qelaoun, successeur de Baybars, il fut taxé de pusillanimité."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "a3cf8cfc-0043-43e0-be93-86597e416fbb",
                                                "sense_id": "353ea9bb-71b1-30e6-be6c-2f14fe3bc16a",
                                                "text": "Cette pusillanimité me conduisait à limiter prudemment tout ce que je publiais, en dehors des traductions, à des formes brèves telles que la nouvelle et le poème ; j’étais encore loin d’avoir le courage de commencer un roman (cela devait encore durer près de trente ans)."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "28800372-70f7-4bcb-abe2-6b30dec7e906",
                        "source_entry_id": "5062322b-173d-331e-8857-479d2f8f02e0",
